<app-header title="{{view === 'feed' ? '羽迹' : view === 'compose' ? '写一篇帖子' : '讨论详情'}}" back="{{view !== 'feed'}}" bindback="back" />
<view class="page {{focusedPage ? 'focused-page' : ''}}"><block wx:if="{{view === 'feed'}}"><view class="eyebrow">发现，也可以一起分享</view><view class="title">鸟友讨论</view><view class="subtitle">一条鸟讯，一个问题，一段观察故事。</view><button class="wide" bindtap="compose">＋ 写一篇帖子</button><button class="text-button spaced" bindtap="loadDraft">继续本机草稿</button>
  <view wx:for="{{posts}}" wx:key="id" class="post-card"><view class="row"><view class="author-avatar">{{item.author}}</view><view><view class="strong">{{item.author}}</view><view class="tiny">观鸟讨论 · {{item.sample ? '示例内容' : '本机草稿'}}</view></view></view><view data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="open"><view class="post-title">{{item.title}}</view><view class="post-body">{{item.body}}</view><image wx:if="{{item.image}}" class="post-photo" src="{{item.image}}" mode="aspectFill" /><view wx:if="{{item.sample}}" class="tiny art-caption">示例插画</view></view><view class="post-actions"><button data-id="{{item.id}}" data-kind="liked" bindtap="react" class="{{item.liked ? 'is-on' : ''}}"><image class="i" src="/assets/icons/heart.png" />{{item.likes + (item.liked ? 1 : 0)}}</button><button data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="open"><image class="i" src="/assets/icons/chat.png" />{{item.replies.length}} 回复</button><button data-id="{{item.id}}" data-kind="saved" bindtap="react" class="{{item.saved ? 'is-on' : ''}}"><image class="i" src="/assets/icons/collection.png" />{{item.saved ? '已保存' : '保存'}}</button></view></view><view class="tiny spaced">社区内容为示例；点赞与书签只保存在本机。</view>
</block>
<block wx:elif="{{view === 'post'}}"><view class="row" bindtap="author"><view class="author-avatar">{{current.author}}</view><view><view class="strong">{{current.author}}</view><view class="tiny">示例鸟友 · 查看主页</view></view></view><view class="title post-detail-title">{{current.title}}</view><view class="post-body">{{current.body}}</view><image class="post-photo" src="{{current.image}}" mode="aspectFill" /><view class="tiny art-caption">示例插画 · 非实际观察</view><view class="section-title">回复 · {{current.replies.length}}</view><view wx:for="{{current.replies}}" wx:key="index" class="reply"><view class="strong">{{item.author}}</view><view>{{item.body}}</view></view><text class="label">写下你的回复</text><textarea auto-height value="{{reply}}" data-key="reply" bindinput="change" placeholder="分享你观察到的线索…" /><button class="primary wide spaced" bindtap="sendReply">发送回复</button></block>
<block wx:else><view class="title">把发现分享给鸟友</view><view class="subtitle">公开发布与私人观察分别管理。</view><text class="label">标题</text><input value="{{title}}" data-key="title" bindinput="change" placeholder="给这次发现一个标题" /><text class="label">内容</text><textarea class="compose-body" auto-height value="{{body}}" data-key="body" bindinput="change" maxlength="-1" placeholder="一段观察、一点疑问，或你的感想…" /><button class="ai-button wide spaced post-writing-entry" bindtap="openWriting">✧ AI 辅助写作</button><image wx:if="{{image}}" src="{{image}}" class="post-photo spaced" mode="aspectFill" /><button class="quiet wide spaced" bindtap="attach">＋ 添加照片</button><view class="choice-row"><button bindtap="saveDraft">保存本机草稿</button><button class="primary" bindtap="publish">发布到讨论</button></view><view class="tiny">服务尚未接入，点击发布会保留草稿并提示状态。</view></block>
<view wx:if="{{error}}" class="note error">{{error}}</view></view>

<view wx:if="{{writingOpen}}" class="modal-backdrop" catchtap="closeWriting" />
<scroll-view wx:if="{{writingOpen}}" scroll-y class="post-writing-sheet"><view class="post-writing-body"><view class="handle" /><view class="row between"><view class="section-title">✧ 帖子写作助手</view><button class="icon-button" bindtap="closeWriting" aria-label="关闭写作助手"><image class="i" src="/assets/icons/close.png" /></button></view><view class="muted">先留下你的观察和想法，再整理成适合分享的文字。</view><view class="label">想怎么写</view><picker range="{{writingPurposes}}" value="{{writingPurpose}}" bindchange="writingPurpose"><view class="select-field">{{writingPurposes[writingPurpose]}}<view class="chevron" /></view></picker><view class="label">补充想法或要求</view><textarea auto-height value="{{writingInstructions}}" bindinput="writingInstructions" maxlength="1200" placeholder="如：想问鸟友是不是同一种鸟，语气自然一点，不补写未知地点。" /><button wx:if="{{image}}" class="writing-image-option" bindtap="writingImage" aria-pressed="{{writingIncludeImage}}"><view class="writing-checkbox">{{writingIncludeImage ? '✓' : ''}}</view><image src="{{image}}" mode="aspectFill" /><text>关联当前照片</text></button><view class="note">AI 写作服务待接入；目前只整理要求，保留原文，未发送文字或照片。接入后先预览、确认采用，再由你发布。</view><view wx:if="{{writingSummary}}" class="writing-summary">{{writingSummary}}</view><view wx:if="{{writingError}}" class="note error">{{writingError}}</view><button class="ai-button wide spaced" bindtap="prepareWriting">准备写作请求</button><button class="quiet wide spaced" bindtap="closeWriting">返回帖子继续编辑</button></view></scroll-view>
